### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect failed request statuses and matching client/server logs. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Invalid input, unavailable collections, unloaded indexes or server-side errors.

### Fix
Correct the recorded failure cause and verify collection/index readiness.

### Verify
Failed request rate is zero while successful requests remain present. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
